    "features": "Look for a readable rules panel, card sorting, a clear turn indicator, declaration confirmation and a score explanation. These are useful evaluation points, not confirmed features of TOP Rummy. If different rooms appear, compare their rules individually. Practice rooms, tournaments, languages, chat and account recovery remain unverified. A rummy title alone does not prove multiplayer availability or a specific matchmaking system.",
    "understandingSection": "Playing guidance",
    "understanding": "In a practice hand, sort cards by suit and rank so possible runs are visible. Reconsider isolated cards as the hand changes rather than keeping them solely for their face value. Use the score screen to understand a completed round. A tutorial can explain decisions, but no arrangement strategy guarantees a winning hand. If the interface loses connection, read its reconnection and timeout rules before starting another round.",
